# The repo-wide .gitignore drops *.pcap, because that is what a simulation writes.
# The captures in this directory tree are corpus data, not output, so keep them
# visible to git -- otherwise a newly added capture is silently left out of the
# commit. (wireshark/ keeps its own stricter rule: everything there is ignored
# until a vetted capture is force-added.)
!*.pcap
!*.cap
